{"5109820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flesh Pit", "steam_appid": 5109820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flesh Pit is a decremental horror game about tossing human gibs into a hole. It's the Boss's orders: The Flesh Pit needs to be emptied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISPOSE OF THE FLESH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss flesh into the hole to earn cash. Unlock tools and upgrades to funnel more flesh into that dang hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109820/extras/5fb988785c91bec62c3f79b946eb5ff4.poster.avif?t=1787889766\" width=1110 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109820/extras/5fb988785c91bec62c3f79b946eb5ff4.webm?t=1787889766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109820/extras/5fb988785c91bec62c3f79b946eb5ff4.mp4?t=1787889766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNBOX COOL LOOT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, it's all just flesh. We've got boxes of the stuff. Tons if it. As in.. TONNES. Take it. Take everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109820/extras/62048a92564f9aa87b2f9f649cb2c0aa.poster.avif?t=1787889766\" width=1110 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109820/extras/62048a92564f9aa87b2f9f649cb2c0aa.webm?t=1787889766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109820/extras/62048a92564f9aa87b2f9f649cb